{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1223204001:1":{"text":"なんだぁ、てめぇ！ちゃんと事前に交渉したし、未払いは違法だろうが！？","source_cn":"混蛋啊！我们谈好的价格，你想赖账吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAF9AF07FF6743FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223204002:1":{"text":"違法？ギャングのお前らが法律を持ち込むとは笑える。","source_cn":"赖账？这句话从你们水鬼帮嘴里说出来真是好笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA67A079B97BF453C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223204003:1":{"text":"着服、横領、お前らのオハコだろ？それともお前は、盗みをするときに対価を払ったか？","source_cn":"这不是你们最擅长的吗，抢我们东西的时候，你们付过钱了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DC0FE40ED8276CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223204004:1":{"text":"減らず口を。とにかく、働いた分のカネは払いやがれ！","source_cn":"别耍嘴皮子，帮你做了事，你就得付钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x209F80878FC2C436","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223204005:1":{"text":"いいだろう。お前が先に、これまで盗んだ分の対価を払ったらな。","source_cn":"行啊，你先付抢的东西的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3032853139F6203E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223204006:1":{"text":"いい加減にしろよ。どうやら痛い目に遭いたいようだな。","source_cn":"别耍心眼，想吃点苦头是吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6AADDAF89DF4501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223204007:1":{"text":"なんだ、手を出すのか？見てみろよ、大勢集まってきてるぞ。","source_cn":"你们敢动手吗？这段时间，大家都提着一口气盯着你们呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D32488FBC71B745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223204008:1":{"text":"ここで手を出せば、せっかく苦労して築いてきた信……","source_cn":"你们要是动手，好不容易建立起来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9D7E928C072FEFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223204009:0":{"text":"ぐぁっ、誰だ！？","source_cn":"哎呦，谁打我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6D22460C7C86A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1223204010:1":{"text":"たとえギャングが相手でも……悪さをする奴は、騎士ロンロンが許しませんよ！","source_cn":"仓鼠骑士满满，不允许坏蛋在这里欺负人，即使欺负的是水鬼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CDE983014B52F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1223204011:1":{"text":"面白いじゃねぇか！お前が呼んだのか？それで俺がビビると？","source_cn":"好啊！你还叫了人是吧？我怕你们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF0437F51891181F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223204012:1":{"text":"野郎ども、かかれ！","source_cn":"兄弟们，给我上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C79522F4DFAE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮梭罗":{"text":"ギャングのソロー","source":"水鬼帮梭罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蛮横的混混":{"text":"横暴なチンピラ","source":"蛮横的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}